  "description": "<p><strong>About the Brand:</strong><br>I'm Anna, the owner of Boho Babe Mockups. I run a successful <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/shop/BohoBabeMockups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Etsy shop</strong></a> with over <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">20,000+ sales</span>.&nbsp;I recently decided to start a website selling my boho styled digital clothing mockups for print on demand sellers.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product description:</strong><br>Digital Clothing Mockups for popular print on demand sellers which feature popular brands such as Gildan, Bella Canvas, Comfort Colors etc. <br><br>I offer various mid-high priced items that are proven best sellers, and have received an average rating of&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>4.97 stars</strong> over almost <strong>5000 reviews</strong></span>.&nbsp;<br><br>The Mockups are professional studio quality images of real authentic products <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">(Not AI)</span></strong>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>My best selling and most popular item by far, is the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Wholeshop Bundle</span> priced at <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>$39,60</strong></span>.&nbsp;It includes all of my current and future mockups. Selling this will put almost <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">$8 in your pocket!</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment terms:</strong><br>I will transfer the earnings you make at the end of each month, when finalizing my books with my accountant.<br><br><strong>Affiliate average earning:</strong><br>Whiel I'm new and don't have this direct information.<br>I can tell you that my average order is around $11-12 dollars on Etsy. So it should be around <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">$2.2 to $2.4</span>.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>This is a limited time offer if you're interested. I suggest getting on board as soon as possible, as&nbsp;future affiliate membership will no longer be open to everyone.<br><br><a href=\"https://bohobabemockups.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>My Website Link &gt;</strong></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/shop/BohoBabeMockups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Etsy Store Link &gt;</strong></a><br><br></p>",
